[00:00.00] 〈intro〉
[00:11.61] 〈drums in〉

[00:17.48] I took half of Unixporn
[00:23.29] Vaxry's Hyprland, cracked and clean
[00:29.09] Slapped it on Arch and called it home
[00:34.89] Chef's choice — you don't pick the scene
[00:40.70] Not a construction-kit burger
[00:46.50] I plate the meal, you sit and eat
[00:52.31] Seventy-five things were slightly wrong
[00:58.11] Colors off, the stack incomplete
[01:03.92] Between the hours at Le Mans
[01:09.72] I built the machine I wanted to touch
[01:15.52] No grand roadmap, just an obsession
[01:21.33] A love letter I shipped too much

[01:27.13] 〈break〉

[01:38.74][03:34.82] Hyprland and Arch never felt this easy
[01:44.54][03:40.63] Smoothest system under my fingers
[01:50.35][03:46.43] We are not looking for mainstream
[01:56.15][03:52.23] We are looking for awesome
[02:01.96][03:58.04] Computers should be fun
[02:07.76][04:03.84] This is for people who love computers
[02:13.56][04:09.65] I will pick them for you
[02:19.37][04:15.45] Omarchy after dark

[02:25.17] A trillion tools in Linux land
[02:30.98] A million ways to get it wrong
[02:36.78] I poured the competency in
[02:42.59] So you can sit and just belong
[02:48.39] You can tweak it, make it yours
[02:54.19] Every default still changeable
[03:00.00] But I will not apologize
[03:05.80] For choosing what is beautiful
[03:11.61] From USB to first commit
[03:17.41] Fifteen minutes, lights are on
[03:23.21] The year of Linux on the desktop
[03:29.02] All the pieces — time to go all in

[04:21.26] Vibe-code the operating system
[04:24.16] Change the wallpaper with your voice
[04:27.06] Agent in the bar, hotkey open
[04:29.96] Your computer. Make it yours.

[04:32.87][02:19.37][04:15.45] Omarchy… after dark
[04:35.77][01:56.15][03:52.23] We are looking for awesome
[04:38.67][02:01.96][03:58.04] Computers should be fun
